    "long_instructions": "##Retro Food Delivery Website\r\n\r\nYou will be creating a web page for food delivery company from 30 years ago! The internet has changed a lot since then, so use the AI Chat to get suggestions about what you could add into your design\r\n\r\nChoose three suggestions that you like, write them down, and move onto the next level to create your site.",
